title: "agent-security-lab"
abstract: >-
  Research and engineering lab investigating the security of tool-using AI
  agents, including indirect prompt injection via poisoned retrieval corpora
  and the empirical evaluation of probabilistic and deterministic mitigations
  against secret exfiltration.
